-[0m[32mFrom a conservative constitutional perspective, this ties to fundamental rights. If we recognize that unborn human life deserves protection, then laws restricting abortion fall within legitimate government authority—protecting innocent life is a core government function. This isn't government overreach; it's government fulfilling its basic responsibility to protect the vulnerable.
