-[0m[32mThat's an important constitutional question. From a conservative perspective, I believe we should ground abortion policy in objective biological reality rather than judicial preferences. Medical science increasingly shows that unborn life has recognizable characteristics much earlier than previously thought—heartbeat, brainwave activity, and capacity to feel pain occur well before viability.
