-[0m[32m
-[0m[32mSecond, states do have some legitimate tools: they can regulate their own medical facilities and professionals, encourage adoption and support services, and educate citizens about alternatives. But frankly, if we believe unborn life deserves protection, we need a broader national conversation about restoring a culture that values life and supports mothers.
