-[0m[32m
-[0m[32mRegarding practical impacts across income levels, it's worth considering several points. First, the amendment doesn't prohibit abortion access—it simply says federal tax dollars won't subsidize it. Women of all income levels retain the legal right to pursue abortion if they choose, and many private insurance plans and organizations do cover it.
