-[0m[32mThe deeper issue here is that 'reproductive autonomy' shouldn't override our collective responsibility to protect unborn life. We can simultaneously respect women's agency while recognizing that unborn children have inherent value and dignity that deserves legal protection. Government neutrality on abortion funding isn't discrimination—it's principled restraint that respects diverse moral beliefs in a pluralistic society.<|im_end|>[0m
