-[0m[32m
-[0m[32mBeyond bans, we need robust support systems: state-funded mental health services specifically for LGBTQ+ youth, including therapy from affirming practitioners who understand conversion therapy trauma. School policies must create safe environments and comprehensive sex education that affirms sexual orientation and gender identity. We should also mandate insurance coverage for affirming mental healthcare as part of universal healthcare expansion.
-[0m[32m
-[0m[32mThis is fundamentally about collective welfare and protecting our most vulnerable members. When we allow industries to traumatize youth with impunity, we're failing in our responsibility to ensure equal dignity and safety for all citizens, regardless of sexual orientation or gender identity.<|im_end|>[0m[33m
