-[0m[32mThis is exactly why we need systemic solutions rather than relying on market-based approaches or charity. Universal healthcare would guarantee all survivors—regardless of family income—access to affirming mental health care as a fundamental right. Under a comprehensive single-payer system, therapy and trauma counseling would be covered without copays or coverage denials.
-[0m[32m
-[0m[32mWe also need targeted government programs specifically supporting LGBTQ+ youth recovery. This means:
-[0m[32m
-[0m[32m**Federal funding for community mental health centers** in underserved areas with trained trauma specialists, including sliding-scale or free services for low-income families.
-[0m[32m
