-[0m[32m
-[0m[32mThe private insurance model perpetuates inequality—wealthy families access better care while poor families struggle. We have the resources to treat healthcare as the public good it is. When we invest collectively in recovery infrastructure, we affirm that every young person's wellbeing matters equally. That's the foundation of a just society.<|im_end|>[0m
