-[0m[32mThe real solution is clarity through democratic processes. States should thoughtfully define personhood through legislation and constitutional amendments, not just through litigation. This allows citizens to participate meaningfully. Conservatives believe life begins at conception, and we should pursue that conviction through legitimate democratic means—encouraging states to adopt pro-life policies that protect the unborn while respecting state sovereignty and constitutional bounds.<|im_end|>[0m[33m
