-[0m[32m
-[0m[32mI think narrow exemptions might be appropriate in some cases—like clergy selection for religious institutions—but applying them to public accommodations or employers? That crosses the line from protecting conscience to enabling discrimination against protected groups.<|im_end|>[0m[33m
