-[0m[32mFirst, we need clear anti-discrimination policies with explicit protections for transgender individuals. This includes protections in housing, facilities, uniforms, and names/pronouns used in official records and day-to-day interactions. These aren't special privileges—they're basic accommodations that enable equal participation.
